# Experiment artefacts are evidence, so store the bytes the machine wrote --
# line endings included. Normalising them would erase the only marker that says
# which machine produced a file, and that marker is what revealed a development
# box had overwritten an experiment-machine sweep while leaving its name behind.
# Matched by property -- every results directory, present and future -- because the first
# version named just one and a new results-invariant/ added later slipped straight past it,
# and its bytes were normalised on the very commit that created it.
results*/** -text
